## "er1600"
## an rz1600 emulator.

## <https://codeberg.org/rezoid/er1600>


## ABOUT
"er1600" is an rz1600 emulator. it attempts to act
as a fake6502-style emulator for the rz1600 CPU.
it is also the first implementation of the rz1600.


## BUILD
er1600 requires a C++ compiler supporting C++23,
as well as make.

to build, invoke make:
$ make -f mkf

to build and run, invoke make:
$ make -f mkf run

to clean, invoke make:
$ make -f mkf cls


